  body: "# Full Decision makers guide collection\n\nMetadata census of 331 linked PDFs across volumes
    1–14, memos and references. Only the existing 36 Pension Credit PDFs have been acquired for full-text
    search.\n\n[Official publication](https://www.gov.uk/government/collections/decision-makers-guide-staff-guide).
    [Frozen census and receipts](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/tree/main/source/discovery-2026-09-15).
    DWP distinguishes DMG and ADM applicability; similar terms do not establish identical conditions across
    benefits. The metadata observation date does not establish current legal applicability."
